      "imageURL": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2024/01/10/multimedia/nb-chicken-and-chickpea-salad-kglm/nb-chicken-and-chickpea-salad-kglm-threeByTwoMediumAt2X.jpg",
      "addedBy": "eR9gJQK1eBflP9syhPRtPbiF6Kh2",
